id: pure-form-sensation-of-purity
name: Sensation of Purity
order: 7
slot: legendary
description: >
  You are most free when you do not make use of your ability to absorb others, making it easier for you to move around.
text: >
  Sensation of Purity: You are most free when you do not make use of your ability to absorb others, making it easier for you to move around.
  (1)-[Passive]: You gain access to the 7th effect of Erratic Majin and the 3rd and 4th effects of Unpredictable even while not in the Pure Form Transformation.
  (2)-[Passive]: While in the Superior State, increase your Surgency by 2(T).
  (3)-[Triggered]: If you roll a 6 on your Chaos Die, regain Life and Ki Points equal to 1/2 of your Surgency.

